## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Hook overhead slows SessionStart | Orchestrator budget <5s; early-exit on no-op |
| Stage0 becomes more complex | Trace logging is append-only; knob loading is 1 JSON read |
| Circular dependency | Clear sequence: outcome → attribute → edit → [wait N cases] → evaluate |
